OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment rejects MP's plea for
OL,4,AA38 intervention
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has been accused of
OL,7,F"washing its hands of any
OL,8,Fresponsibility" after rejecting an MP's
OL,9,Fcall to intervene in a #50m road
OL,10,Fimprovement scheme.
OL,12,FBromsgrove MP Bradley Thomas wrote to
OL,13,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,14,Flast month urging her to instruct
OL,15,FNational Highways to take over delivery
OL,16,Fof the Bromsgrove Route Enhancement
OL,17,FProgramme (BREP).
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
