OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment rejects MP's plea for
OL,4,AA38 intervention
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas told the BBC he had become
OL,7,Fincreasingly frustrated with
OL,8,FWorcestershire County Council's
OL,9,Fhandling of the project, claiming the
OL,10,Fauthority "lacks the expertise to
OL,11,Fdeliver a scheme of this importance".
OL,13,FA government spokesperson said the
OL,14,FDepartment for Transport (DfT)
OL,15,Fcontinued to monitor the progress of
OL,16,FBREP and work with the council.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
